<!--
    The launcher's copy of the mark, held further off the edge of the tile.

    An inset rather than a second drawing of it: the safe-zone scale in
    ic_blogmark_mark is the most a mark may be, not the most it should be, and
    a launcher icon that runs to the edge of its mask reads as cramped next to
    every other icon on the home screen, which sit in far more air than the
    mask strictly requires. The splash has a whole screen and needs no such
    restraint, so the two sizes genuinely differ — and this is still one
    geometry, wrapped, rather than a second copy free to drift from it.
-->
<inset xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:drawable="@drawable/ic_blogmark_mark"
    android:inset="13%" />
